   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Is the solution strategy used in solving the linear equation correct? If it is correct, show the final step (check the solution). If it is not correct, explain why.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{8\\left( {x-2} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6\\left( {x + 10} \\right)}\\\\{8x-16}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6x + 60}\\\\{8x-16{\\mathbf\\,{-\\,6x}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6x + 60{\\mathbf\\,{-\\,6x}}}\\\\{2x-16 + {\\mathbf{16}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{60 + {\\mathbf{16}}}\\\\{2x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{76}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{38}\\end{array}\">{8\\left( {x-2} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6\\left( {x + 10} \\right)}\\\\{8x-16}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6x + 60}\\\\{8x-16{\\mathbf\\,{-\\,6x}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6x + 60{\\mathbf\\,{-\\,6x}}}\\\\{2x-16 + {\\mathbf{16}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{60 + {\\mathbf{16}}}\\\\{2x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{76}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{38}\\end{array}</span>",
