     "content_html": "It is a correct solution strategy.<br>\nLet<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{38}\\\\{8\\left( {38-2} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{6\\left( {38 + 10} \\right)}\\\\{8\\left( {36} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{6\\left( {48} \\right)}\\\\{288}&amp;{ = }&amp;{288 ✓}\\\\\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{38}\\\\{8\\left( {38-2} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6\\left( {38 + 10} \\right)?}\\\\{8\\left( {36} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{6\\left( {48} \\right)?}\\\\{288}&amp;{ = }&amp;{288 ✓}\\\\\\end{array}</span>"
